Package: aRchtest
Title: Declare and Enforce Architectural Rules in Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Fabian", "Distler", , "fdistlermpi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Declare dependency rules between the modules of an R project
    and enforce them as ordinary 'testthat' tests. Rules are built with a
    small pipe-friendly domain-specific language and checked by static
    analysis of the project sources, so the code under analysis is never
    sourced, loaded or evaluated.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fabiandistler/aRchtest
BugReports: https://github.com/fabiandistler/aRchtest/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    data.table
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
